 "notes": "Vertical stem with wedge ends; two stadium loops and two bow-ties on its left, a wavy-shafted arrow flying off to the left; on the right a large elliptical arc studded with rings (two on top, three outside, one inside), a spiral curl, a chevron, a flared cross inside, a stepped key with two small rings, a diagonal from the stem to the arc's foot with three rings hung from it, a spiral at the foot and an S-scroll below. Cursive, no symmetry."
